1. Definitions

   "Software" means the OpenCred source code, binaries, documentation, and
   associated assets in this repository, including the @opencred/* packages.

   "Verification Use" means installing and running the Software (including
   the @opencred/verify SDK) within your own services for the purpose of
   verifying credentials issued by OpenCred-based issuers.

   "Issuer Use" means deploying the OpenCred Desktop Client or the OpenCred
   Docker image within your own organisation to issue verifiable
   credentials under your own keys.

